gn: center; background-color: #ffffff;\">100万+</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 20%; height: 21px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #333333; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; text-align: center; background-color: #ffffff;\">388元</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 20%; height: 21px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #333333; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; text-align: center; background-color: #ffffff;\">188元</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 20%; height: 21px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #333333; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; text-align: center; background-color: #ffffff;\">288元</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 21px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 20%; height: 21px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #333333; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; text-align: center; background-color: #ffffff;\">VIP6</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 20%; height: 21px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #333333; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; text-align: center; background-color: #ffffff;\">500万+</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 20%; height: 21px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #333333; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; text-align: center; background-color: #ffffff;\">888元</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 20%; height: 21px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #333333; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; text-align: center; background-color: #ffffff;\">388元</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 20%; height: 21px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #333333; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; text-align: center; background-color: #ffffff;\">388元</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 21px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 20%; height: 21px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #333333; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; text-align: center; background-color: #ffffff;\">VIP7</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 20%; height: 21px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #333333; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; text-align: center; background-color: #ffffff;\">800万+</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 20%; height: 21px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #333333; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; text-align: center; background-color: #ffffff;\">1588元</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 20%; height: 21px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #333333; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; text-align: center; background-color: #ffffff;\">588元</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 20%; height: 21px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #333333; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; text-align: center; background-color: #ffffff;\">588元</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 21px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 20%; height: 21px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #333333; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; text-align: center; background-color: #ffffff;\">VIP8</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 20%; height: 21px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #333333; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; text-align: center; background-color: #ffffff;\">1000万+</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 20%; height: 21px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #333333; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; text-align: center; background-color: #ffffff;\">2588元</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 20%; height: 21px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #333333; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; text-align: center; background-color: #ffffff;\">888元</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 20%; height: 21px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #333333; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; text-align: center; background-color: #ffffff;\">888元</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 21px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 20%; height: 21px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #333333; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; text-align: center; background-color: #ffffff;\">VIP9</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 20%; height: 21px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #333333; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; text-align: center; background-color: #ffffff;\">5000万+</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 20%; height: 21px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #333333; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; text-align: center; background-color: #ffffff;\">3888元</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 20%; height: 21px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #333333; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; text-align: center; background-color: #ffffff;\">1588元</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 20%; height: 21px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #333333; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; text-align: center; background-color: #ffffff;\">1888元</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 21px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 20%; height: 21px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #333333; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; text-align: center; background-color: #ffffff;\">SVIP</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 20%; height: 21px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #333333; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; text-align: center; background-color: #ffffff;\">1亿+</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 20%; height: 21px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #333333; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; text-align: center; background-color: #ffffff;\">8888元</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 20%; height: 21px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #333333; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; text-align: center; background-color: #ffffff;\">2588元</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 20%; height: 21px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #333333; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; text-align: center; background-color: #ffffff;\">3888元</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: #333333; font-family: Arial, \'Microsoft JhengHei\', sans-serif; font-size: 15px; background-color: #ffffff;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: #333333; font-family: Arial, \'Microsoft JhengHei\', sans-serif; font-size: 15px; background-color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">1、成为VIP会员更能享受专用线路、存取款加速通道（我们奉行3分钟存款到账/5分钟内提款到账的服务原则, VIP会员等级越高, 处理效率越优先）</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: #333333; font-family: Arial, \'Microsoft JhengHei\', sans-serif; font-size: 15px; background-color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">2、VIP6以上会员将获得联系我们特别的VIP客服经理，联系在线客服获取联系方式，提供24小时专业服务，她将尽力满足您每一个要求</span></p>', null, '<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: #333333; font-family: Arial, \'Microsoft JhengHei\', sans-serif; font-size: 15px; background-color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">1、所有优惠以人民币（CNY）为结算金额，以美东时间（EDT）为计时区间。</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: #333333; font-family: Arial, \'Microsoft JhengHei\', sans-serif; font-size: 15px; background-color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">2、每位玩家、住址、电话、邮箱、相同支付卡/信用卡号、及共享电脑环境（例如网吧、其他公用电脑等）只能拥有一个会员享受优惠红利，如发现同一会员注册多账号行为，将收回全部优惠红利。</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: #333333; font-family: Arial, \'Microsoft JhengHei\', sans-serif; font-size: 15px; background-color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">3、所有的活动优惠特为玩家而设，如发现任何团体或个人，以不诚实的方式套取红利或任何威胁、滥用公司优惠等行为，公司保留冻结、取消该团体或个人账户及账户结余的权利。</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: #333333; font-family: Arial, \'Microsoft JhengHei\', sans-serif; font-size: 15px; background-color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">4、TG保留所有解释权，在任何时候都可以更改、停止、取消优惠活动。</span></p>', null, '7', 'images/8dc2499031a6e9a43a52546b1de96b98.png', '1', '1', '2021-10-25 11:05:57', '2022-07-12 17:36:57');
